    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEARCH ALL - SNAKES</h2> - This is a game in the \u201csearch for objects\u201d genre, in which you need to find all the snakes in a large location. Snakes will be located in a variety of places, from the most visible to barely noticeable places. The entire game location looks animated due to the animation elements. Find all the snakes! Don't let them go unnoticed :)<br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br>  - Animation elements on the location;<br>  - 100 snakes to find;<br>  - Pleasant soundtrack;<br>  - The gameplay can be interrupted at any time, and the game will automatically save the result;<br>  - Hints implemented! If you have trouble finding an item, use the hint!",
